-- Source: Guides/SurvivalGuide/A-Classic-Alliance-11-16_NightElf.lua; block SHA256: 08be64f54e6c1e028f8e95e9b0e9e26e16a607fb5e6a34fa0a2bc8aa108ba63c
RXPGuides.RegisterGuide([[
#hardcore
<< ac335 Alliance !DK !Draenei !BloodElf
#group Original Guides - RestedXP Hardcore Classic Guides (A)
#subgroup Experimental Classic Survival
#name 13-13 Loch Modan (Night Elf)
#version 1
#next 13-15 Westfall

step
    +Experimental upstream Classic route adapted for 3.3.5. Deathless guidance does not enforce server rules or guarantee survival. Check this instruction to continue.
step
    >>From Ironforge, enter the Deeprun Tram in Tinker Town. Ride to the Stormwind end and exit into Stormwind. If resuming in Wetlands, first follow the Dun Algaz road through Loch Modan and Dun Morogh to Ironforge. No coastal swim or external relocation is needed.
    .zone Stormwind City >>Reach Stormwind by the Tram
step
    +You have arrived in Stormwind by the Tram. Continue with the following vendor, flight-path and Tram quest stops; the old Westfall shoreline detour is not needed. Check this reminder to continue.
step
    .zone Stormwind City >>Be in Stormwind for the following vendor and flight-path stops
step
